          "中文：今天所有主名单默认都要先满足“回踩缩量企稳”或“放量二次确认”；在09:30 PMI公布前后尤其不接受第一根冲高K直接变成买点。\nEN: Every main-list item today defaults to requiring either lighter-volume pullback stabilization or a second volume confirmation; especially around the 09:30 PMI release, the first spike candle is not accepted as a buy point by itself.",
          "中文：T+1意味着即使盘中一度盈利，只要次日不能卖在理想价格，错误买点就会被放大，因此首笔仓位必须克制。\nEN: T+1 means that even if there is intraday profit, a bad entry can be magnified when the next day cannot be exited at the ideal price, so first fills must stay disciplined.",
